#
# Counter-example for math:RationalValueShape: a math:RationalValue whose
# math:denominator is 0. p/0 is not a rational value, so the exact carrier is
# ill-formed. The numerator is present and both are integers, so ONLY the
# sh:not [ sh:hasValue 0 ] constraint fires. Validation MUST emit
# shacl.NotConstraintComponent and no other finding (math:ZeroDenominator).
# Bound by tests/example-conformance.ttl (ex:ecRationalValueZeroDenominator).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:zeroDenomRational a math:RationalValue ;
    math:numerator 1 ;
    math:denominator 0 .
